# Machdyne Lakritz: ECP5 LFE5U-25F in CABGA256.
#
#   zfpga build /fpga/examples/blink.v -b lakritz
#
# The pins are the tree's own boards/lakritz_v0.lpf, installed beside
# this file as lakritz.lpf. `pack -c`: compressed, which is what Zeitlos's
# own build uses (its --freq 2.4 is the power-on default, the same bytes).
device  LFE5U-25F
package CABGA256
lpf     lakritz.lpf
pack    -c
